title: "decryptSealedBid (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_key: check privateKey is published
    q_check_key --> q_revert_key: privateKey not yet published
    q_revert_key --> [*]: revert PrivateKeyNotPublished
    q_check_key --> q_get_bid: privateKey available
    q_get_bid --> q_decrypt: retrieve encrypted bid data for investor
    q_decrypt --> [*]: return ECIES_decrypt(privateKey, encryptedBid)

    note right of q_decrypt
        INV-001: decryption only possible after privateKey publication
        INV-002: anyone can verify bid amounts post-publication
        INV-003: decrypted bid reveals true price/amount committed by investor
    end note
